## ⚠️ MANDATORY: Review Routing

When you see ANY of these patterns, you MUST use the `cpp-core-review` skill:
- "review" + C++ file/code
- "audit" + C++ file/code
- "check" + C++ file/code
- "inspect" + C++ file/code
- "critique" + C++ file/code
- "审查" / "检查" + C++ file/code

Do NOT review C++ code with your own knowledge. Always invoke the skill first.

